<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-10-23T23:14:33+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Fri, 23 Oct 2026 23:14:33 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[Rhode Island volunteers reused 600+ Christmas trees to restore riverbanks and protect young trout]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135152075.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In an inspiring environmental effort, volunteers in Rhode Island gathered over 600 old Christmas trees for the 'Trees for Trout' initiative, aimed at restoring riverbanks. By bringing their discarded trees to designated collection sites at Arcadia Management Area, residents have made a significant contribution toward creating sustainable trout habitats and mitigating soil erosion. This project not only enhances local waterways but also promotes community involvement in ecological preservation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/rhode-island-collected-more-than-600-unwanted-christmas-trees-in-2026-but-instead-of-sending-them-to-landfills-volunteers-are-placing-them-along-damaged-streams-to-rebuild-riverbanks-and-shelter-young-trout/articleshow/135152075.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/rhode-island-collected-more-than-600-unwanted-christmas-trees-in-2026-but-instead-of-sending-them-to-landfills-volunteers-are-placing-them-along-damaged-streams-to-rebuild-riverbanks-and-shelter-young-trout/articleshow/135152075.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T23:09:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135152358,imgsize-1096870.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Portia gifted Ellen a Rwanda gorilla project in 2018; its campus welcomed 40,000+ visitors by 2023]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135151560.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Portia de Rossi gifted Ellen DeGeneres a conservation project which led to the Ellen DeGeneres Campus opening in Rwanda. The campus supports wildlife protection and offers educational opportunities for local students and communities. Since its opening, it has welcomed numerous visitors and hosted thousands of Rwandan schoolchildren for science lessons. The project emphasizes sustainable practices and aims to monitor and protect endangered mountain gorillas.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2018-portia-de-rossi-surprised-ellen-degeneres-with-a-gorilla-conservation-project-by-september-2023-its-rwanda-campus-had-welcomed-over-40000-visitors-including-more-than-7500-local-schoolchildren/articleshow/135151560.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2018-portia-de-rossi-surprised-ellen-degeneres-with-a-gorilla-conservation-project-by-september-2023-its-rwanda-campus-had-welcomed-over-40000-visitors-including-more-than-7500-local-schoolchildren/articleshow/135151560.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T22:51:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135151822,imgsize-873686.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US midterms 2026: Mark Carney rejects US claim of election interference, says 'no merit']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135151327.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-mid-term-elections/news/us-midterms-2026-mark-carney-rejects-us-claim-of-election-interference-says-no-merit/articleshow/135151327.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-mid-term-elections/news/us-midterms-2026-mark-carney-rejects-us-claim-of-election-interference-says-no-merit/articleshow/135151327.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T22:48:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Gokul Ankari</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135151716,imgsize-712104.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Alicia Keys and Swizz Beatz bought a $20.8M California cliffside home in 2019]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135151251.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Alicia Keys and Swizz Beatz made a significant purchase in 2019, acquiring the Razor House in La Jolla for $20.8 million. This architectural masterpiece, designed by Wallace E. Cunningham, boasts panoramic Pacific Ocean views. The duo transformed this modern creation into a warm family abode, enriched with artworks from the Dean Collection, reflecting Swizz Beatz's dream of a creative hideaway and highlighting the prestige of California's architectural landscape.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2019-alicia-keys-and-swizz-beatz-paid-20-8-million-for-a-glass-walled-california-cliff-house-that-had-originally-been-offered-for-30-million-two-years-later-they-revealed-its-transformation-into-an-art-filled-family-retreat/articleshow/135151251.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2019-alicia-keys-and-swizz-beatz-paid-20-8-million-for-a-glass-walled-california-cliff-house-that-had-originally-been-offered-for-30-million-two-years-later-they-revealed-its-transformation-into-an-art-filled-family-retreat/articleshow/135151251.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T22:40:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135151509,imgsize-1025934.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[1890 Sherlock Holmes first edition found in charity shop sells for £11,520]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135117224.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A first-edition edition of The Sign of Four surfaced among the book donations at an Oxfam shop, piquing the interest of staff who recognized its rare value. After seeking expert appraisal, the book fetched an impressive £11,520 at Bonhams auction house. The funds raised will greatly benefit Oxfam's humanitarian efforts globally, highlighting how valuable donations can be when assessed properly.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-forgotten-1890-first-edition-of-sherlock-holmes-novel-the-sign-of-four-arrived-among-ordinary-charity-shop-donations-in-england-staff-spotted-its-significance-and-it-sold-for-11520/articleshow/135117224.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-forgotten-1890-first-edition-of-sherlock-holmes-novel-the-sign-of-four-arrived-among-ordinary-charity-shop-donations-in-england-staff-spotted-its-significance-and-it-sold-for-11520/articleshow/135117224.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T22:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135117411,imgsize-1419536.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US midterms 2026: Trump admin files lawsuit over Alaska Senate race, seeks to block results if GOP loses]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135150666.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-mid-term-elections/news/us-midterms-2026-trump-admin-files-lawsuit-over-alaska-senate-race-seeks-to-block-results-if-gop-loses/articleshow/135150666.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-mid-term-elections/news/us-midterms-2026-trump-admin-files-lawsuit-over-alaska-senate-race-seeks-to-block-results-if-gop-loses/articleshow/135150666.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T22:04:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Gokul Ankari</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135150857,imgsize-1516189.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Butterflies Rebound After Restoration: Ex-wheat farm records 5,290 in 2026; rare species appear]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135140712.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Halnaker Hill Farm in West Sussex has experienced a remarkable surge in butterfly populations thanks to dedicated habitat restoration initiatives. In the spring of 2026, surveys noted 5,290 butterflies representing 28 different species, including some that are quite rare. This ecological project has fostered a rich variety of habitats that not only attract butterflies but also support bird life and other insects.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/after-40-years-of-wheat-farming-a-330-acre-stretch-of-land-in-england-was-turned-into-a-wildlife-haven-just-two-years-later-surveys-recorded-5290-butterflies-including-rare-species-never-previously-seen-in-the-fields/articleshow/135140712.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/after-40-years-of-wheat-farming-a-330-acre-stretch-of-land-in-england-was-turned-into-a-wildlife-haven-just-two-years-later-surveys-recorded-5290-butterflies-including-rare-species-never-previously-seen-in-the-fields/articleshow/135140712.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T21:52:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135140770,imgsize-876023.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 2017, J.J. Watt donated $100K for Hurricane Harvey relief, raised $41.6M to help Texas flood victims]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135149832.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In 2017, former NFL star J.J. Watt donated $100,000 to launch a fundraiser for Hurricane Harvey victims in Texas. Initially targeting $200,000, the campaign eventually raised $41.6 million by August 2018. The money helped rebuild more than 600 homes, restore over 420 childcare centres, distribute 26 million meals and provide healthcare to thousands.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2017-j-j-watt-donated-100000-to-hurricane-harvey-relief-launching-a-fundraiser-that-raised-41-6-million-to-help-texas-flood-victims-rebuild-over-600-homes-and-restore-more-than-420-childcare-centres/articleshow/135149832.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2017-j-j-watt-donated-100000-to-hurricane-harvey-relief-launching-a-fundraiser-that-raised-41-6-million-to-help-texas-flood-victims-rebuild-over-600-homes-and-restore-more-than-420-childcare-centres/articleshow/135149832.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T21:14:03+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135149908,imgsize-82969.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[71-year-old man killed as Tesla in full self-driving mode hits him on California freeway]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135149630.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/71-year-old-man-killed-as-tesla-in-full-self-driving-mode-hits-him-on-california-freeway/articleshow/135149630.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/71-year-old-man-killed-as-tesla-in-full-self-driving-mode-hits-him-on-california-freeway/articleshow/135149630.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T21:11:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aashish Vashistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135149912,imgsize-93287.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Ugh. They are Black': NYC broker typed text for property owners, mistakenly sent to the couple hunting for apartments]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135150012.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ugh-they-are-black-nyc-broker-typed-text-for-property-owners-mistakenly-sent-to-the-couple-hunting-for-apartments/articleshow/135150012.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ugh-they-are-black-nyc-broker-typed-text-for-property-owners-mistakenly-sent-to-the-couple-hunting-for-apartments/articleshow/135150012.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T21:24:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135150070,imgsize-50418.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Chinese woman breaks 5 ribs from hug, husband says he used normal force, wife does not get sunlight, does extreme dieting]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135149092.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/chinese-woman-breaks-5-ribs-from-hug-husband-says-he-used-normal-force-wife-does-not-get-sunlight-does-extreme-dieting/articleshow/135149092.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/chinese-woman-breaks-5-ribs-from-hug-husband-says-he-used-normal-force-wife-does-not-get-sunlight-does-extreme-dieting/articleshow/135149092.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T20:25:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135149179,imgsize-55028.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Gosling and Mendes bought Joel Schumacher’s California retreat, built from 200-year-old barn timber]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135144104.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In 2014, Ryan Gosling and Eva Mendes purchased a distinctive rustic estate in Carpinteria, California. This property, crafted by Joel Schumacher, is constructed from reclaimed wood of three 200-year-old barns. Designed for privacy and a serene connection to nature, it embodies American history, offering a tranquil retreat from Los Angeles. The couple cherishes their family life away from the spotlight, valuing their children and preserving the estate's unique features.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2014-ryan-gosling-and-eva-mendes-acquired-a-california-retreat-built-using-timber-from-three-200-year-old-barns-the-unusual-property-had-first-been-created-by-batman-director-joel-schumacher/articleshow/135144104.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2014-ryan-gosling-and-eva-mendes-acquired-a-california-retreat-built-using-timber-from-three-200-year-old-barns-the-unusual-property-had-first-been-created-by-batman-director-joel-schumacher/articleshow/135144104.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T20:05:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135148783,imgsize-1131443.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Maine tenants win $3.6m deal after rent-control dispute]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135148425.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Trelawny Tenants Union has achieved a significant milestone, settling for $3.6 million with landlord Geoffrey Rice over improper rent hikes. This reimbursement, affecting more than 1,000 residents for overpayments since 2020, stems from ongoing mediation and legal challenges against violations of rent control laws. Moving forward, the union plans to enforce compliance among landlords in Portland and is exploring a digitized rental registration system for better governance.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/maine-tenants-challenged-rent-increases-under-portlands-rent-control-law-after-a-union-campaign-and-20-hours-of-mediation-their-landlord-agreed-to-a-3-6-million-settlement-to-reimburse-more-than-1000-renters/articleshow/135148425.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/maine-tenants-challenged-rent-increases-under-portlands-rent-control-law-after-a-union-campaign-and-20-hours-of-mediation-their-landlord-agreed-to-a-3-6-million-settlement-to-reimburse-more-than-1000-renters/articleshow/135148425.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T20:08:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135148573,imgsize-505547.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Lauren Conrad’s ‘Laguna Beach’ family mansion, built by James Conrad in 2004, listed for $26.5 million]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135148455.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Lauren Conrad’s family mansion, featured in MTV’s Laguna Beach: The Real Orange County, is listed for $26.5 million. Designed and built in 2004 by her father, architect James Conrad, the nearly 8,000-square-foot Mediterranean-style estate overlooks the Pacific Ocean. Located in Laguna Beach’s exclusive Three Arch Bay community, the property features six bedrooms, an infinity-edge pool and private beach access.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/lauren-conrads-laguna-beach-family-mansion-designed-and-built-by-her-father-james-conrad-in-2004-listed-for-26-5-million-inside-the-8000-square-foot-oceanfront-estate/articleshow/135148455.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/lauren-conrads-laguna-beach-family-mansion-designed-and-built-by-her-father-james-conrad-in-2004-listed-for-26-5-million-inside-the-8000-square-foot-ocea